# reading_translation = The Greeks, the teachers of all learning and of humanity itself, embraced humane and liberal culture in two things, music and gymnastics, of which no one is ignorant that the one comprehends the exercise of the body, the other of the mind, since by the name of music they were accustomed to call not only the faculty of singing with strings or flute or voice, but every culture that proceeds from the Muses.
