# sent_id = orat11.3.8
# text = Mihi quidem, etsi multos scio aliter censere, ambitio non modo non magnum videtur virtutis momentum, sed et in re publica et in litteris malum perniciosissimum esse, neque id in eo, quod nunc ipsum exposui, vitio consistens, sed multo etiam latius grassans.
# reading_translation = For my part, although I know that many think otherwise, ambition seems to me not only not a great force for virtue, but also, both in public life and in letters, to be a most pernicious evil, and that not a fault residing in the very thing I have just now set forth, but one spreading much more widely still.
