# sent_id = orat12.11.1
# text = Quo quum orationis meae cursus deflexerit, verbo mihi monendi estis, commilitones, ut in hac modestia, in hoc obsequio liberali perseveretis, neve unquam obliviscamini, quum omnium universitatum civibus hoc decorum sit, tum vobis debere officium sanctius videri, qui non modo in regia urbe, sed in proxima regiae domus vicinia, immo in ipsis Regis oculis et prospectu versemini.
# reading_translation = Since the course of my speech has turned aside to this point, I must warn you in a word, fellow soldiers, that you should persevere in this moderation, in this liberal obedience, and that you should never forget that, although this is proper for the citizens of all universities, yet to you it ought to seem a more sacred duty, who live not only in the royal city, but in the immediate neighborhood of the royal house, nay, in the very eyes and sight of the King.
