# text = quamquam hoc temporis spatio per integrum fere annum remissa bellico tumultui studia artium sunt, positisque armis nostra schola quasi denuo coepta est, tamen haec, non nostris quidem meritis, sed Principis optimi beneficiis, brevi eo accrevit splendoris ac frequentiae, ut, ne quid arrogantius dicam, nulli Germaniae academiae cedat, plurimas longe longeque superet.
# reading_translation = Although during this period of time, for almost an entire year, the pursuits of the arts have been relaxed because of the turmoil of war, and with arms laid aside our school has been, as it were, begun anew, nevertheless this school, not indeed by our own merits but by the kindnesses of our excellent Prince, has in a short time grown to such a degree of splendor and attendance that, not to say anything too boastful, it yields to no academy of Germany and surpasses very many by far.
