# sent_id = orat14.2.5
# text = tamen quod ab hac, quae mihi proxime assidet, illustriore corona non ea exspectari intelligo, quae vel sua novitate vel gravitate dicendi apta ipsi sint, sed quae monere commilitones si non necessarium certe opus sit, et quae simul ad rerum Friderici Guilelmi auspiciis institutarum laudem referri possint, quoniam in hac philosophiae et historiae cum ceteris disciplinis coniunctione explicanda utrumque inest commodum, de hac, non dialectico acumine, quod scholarum proprium, sed oratorio modo paucis exponere et deinceps eo, unde digressus sum, redire constitui.
# reading_translation = Nevertheless, because I understand that from this more distinguished gathering, which sits nearest to me, what is expected is not those things which might be suited to it either by their novelty or by their weight of eloquence, but rather what it is certainly useful, if not necessary, to remind fellow students of, and what can at the same time be referred to the praise of the undertakings instituted under the auspices of Frederick William, since in explaining this connection of philosophy and history with the other disciplines both advantages are present, I have decided to set forth briefly, not with dialectical subtlety, which is proper to the schools, but in an oratorical manner, and then to return to the point from which I have digressed.
# literal_translation = Nevertheless, because from this, which to me sits nearest, more distinguished crown, not those things to be expected I understand, which either by their novelty or by weight of speaking suited to itself may be, but which to remind fellow students if not necessary certainly useful may be, and which at the same time to the praise of things under the auspices of Frederick William instituted to be referred can, since in this of philosophy and history with the other disciplines connection to be explained both advantages is present, about this, not with dialectical sharpness, which of schools is proper, but in oratorical manner briefly to set forth and afterwards to that, whence I have digressed, to return I have decided.
# generator = deepseek-chat
