# sent_id = orat17.1.11
# text = de qua dicturus sicuti effugiam ipsam speciem assentationis, quamquam mihi inter vos, ut Principi optimo sinceris animis obstrictos, ne metuendam quidem, ita non magis recedam a Friderici Guilelmi egregiis artibus exponendis, quam qui olim Athenis publice constituti erant, ut civium bello caesorum memoriam celebrarent, visi sunt ab argumento deflexisse, ubi patriae enarrabant bona, cui fortes illi bellatores et gloriam commodumque addiderant, et suam ipsi debebant virtutem, educatione et exemplis parentum clarissimis ad res praeclare gerendas formati atque excitati.
# reading_translation = Concerning this, although I am about to speak, I will indeed avoid the very appearance of flattery, although among you, who are bound to the best Prince with sincere hearts, it is not even to be feared; yet I will no more depart from setting forth the distinguished virtues of Frederick William than those who were once publicly appointed at Athens to celebrate the memory of citizens slain in war seemed to have deviated from their subject when they recounted the blessings of their country, to which those brave warriors had added glory and advantage, and to which they themselves owed their valor, having been formed and roused to noble deeds by the education and most illustrious examples of their parents.
# literal_translation = Concerning which about-to-speak I will indeed flee the very appearance of flattery, although among you, to the best Prince with sincere hearts bound, not even to be feared, so no more will I depart from the distinguished virtues of Frederick William to be set forth, than those who once at Athens publicly appointed were, to celebrate the memory of citizens slain in war, seemed from the subject to have deviated, when the blessings of the country they recounted, to which those brave warriors and glory and advantage had added, and their own they owed valor, by education and examples of parents most illustrious to deeds nobly to be done formed and roused.
# generator = deepseek-chat
