# reading_translation = Thus we, the audience, we who are bound by piety to count the years from the most auspicious birthday of Frederick William, have been accustomed in this assembly, when conducting our business, to recall especially the memory of each previous year, and to draw fresh material for rejoicing from the events most recently accomplished, which flowed in from all sides with joyful abundance.
