# sent_id = orat20.2.172
# text = Nempe ille quum libera cogitatione uti suos vellet, qua sola duce inveterati errores et prava generis cuiuslibet instituta corrigi possunt, rectissime haec antiqua et communia generi humano bona probavit, non modo quod imprimis perfecta sunt, sed quod, quid bonum, quid fugiendum sit, virtutes et vitia, populorum et principum res gestas, quibus illi magnitudinem et gloriam vel decrementa et postremo interitum sibi pararunt, integro ex illis iudicio cognoscere licet, non illo occupato praeceptis sententiis, intempestivis studiis, metu odiisque et cupiditatibus, quas praesens quoque aevo et in quaque civitate rerum status excitare solet.
# reading_translation = For when he wished his people to use free thought, by which alone as a guide inveterate errors and the corrupt institutions of any kind whatsoever can be corrected, he most rightly approved these ancient goods common to the human race, not only because they are especially perfect, but because from them one can learn with an unbiased judgment what is good, what is to be avoided, the virtues and vices, the deeds of peoples and princes by which they have procured for themselves greatness and glory or decline and finally destruction, not with that judgment preoccupied by precepts, opinions, untimely studies, fear, hatreds, and desires, which the state of affairs in the present age and in every state is accustomed to excite.
# literal_translation = Namely he when free thought to-use his-own he-wished, by-which alone as-guide inveterate errors and corrupt of-kind any institutions to-be-corrected can, most-rightly these ancient and common to-the-human race goods he-approved, not only because especially perfect they-are, but because, what good, what to-be-avoided is, virtues and vices, of-peoples and of-princes deeds, by-which those greatness and glory or declines and finally destruction for-themselves they-have-procured, with-unbiased from-those judgment to-learn it-is-allowed, not with-that preoccupied by-precepts opinions, untimely studies, fear hatreds-and and desires, which present also in-age and in every state of-affairs state to-excite is-accustomed.
# generator = deepseek-v4-pro
