# sent_id = orat24.2.125
# text = Igitur quoniam nulla aetate atque apud nullum populum desunt qui sibi in eo placeant, ut alant discordias et instigent ad simultates exercendas, ille princeps imprimis laudandus est, qui privatos superet moderatione, et munus sibi a Deo commissum esse hoc sentiat, non ut certaminum strage suos exterosque affligat, quod faciunt qui nulla alia causa nisi ambitionis et cupiditatis explendae suscipiunt bella, sed ut pace adiuvet genus humanum, cui merito exprobratum est, quod homini plurima ex homine sint mala, quum ne beluae quidem nisi in diversa genera saeviant ac ne leonum quidem feritas inter se dimicet.
# reading_translation = Therefore, since in no age and among no people are there lacking those who please themselves in this, that they nourish discords and incite to the exercise of enmities, that prince is especially to be praised who surpasses private individuals in moderation, and feels that a duty has been entrusted to him by God, not to afflict his own people and foreigners with the slaughter of contests, which those do who undertake wars for no other reason than to satisfy ambition and greed, but to aid the human race with peace, to which it has deservedly been reproached that most evils come to man from man, since not even beasts rage except against different species, and not even the ferocity of lions fights among themselves.
# literal_translation = Therefore since in no age and among no people are lacking who themselves in this please, that they nourish discords and incite to enmities to be exercised, that prince first of all to be praised is, who private individuals surpasses in moderation, and a duty to himself by God entrusted to be this feels, not that with slaughter of contests his own and foreigners he afflicts, which do who for no other reason than of ambition and of greed to be satisfied undertake wars, but that with peace he aids the race human, to which deservedly it has been reproached, that to man very many from man are evils, since not even beasts except against different kinds rage and not even of lions ferocity among themselves fights.
# generator = deepseek-v4-pro
