# sent_id = orat26.1.2
# text = sperabam fore, ut si forte me insciente vel affectae vel fatigatae crebra repetitione meae vires essent, hac recrearer quiete, et eximii oratoris exemplum incenderet non voluntatem meam, cuius totiens dedi documenta, sed ingenii aemulationem et ardorem.
# reading_translation = I was hoping that it would happen that, if by chance my strength had been weakened or exhausted by frequent repetition without my knowledge, I would be refreshed by this rest, and that the example of an excellent orator would kindle not my will, of which I have so often given proof, but the emulation and ardor of my talent.
