# sent_id = orat26.7.38
# text = Quo loco vos mihi cohortandi estis, commilitones, ut vos quoque Regi clementissimo, qui vestris prosperitatibus eximie consulit, iis artibus, quibus potestis, referatis gratiam:
# reading_translation = At this point, fellow soldiers, you must be encouraged by me to repay with gratitude, in the ways you can, the most merciful King, who takes exceptional care of your prosperity.
