# sent_id = orat27.5.13
# text = Iam vero rem militarem, quae tamen videbatur sub prioribus regibus optime instructa esse, novo instituto ita ordinavit Fridericus Guilelmus, ut quum prius milites magna ex parte mercenarii essent, aegre isti poenis suppliciisque atrocissimis cohibiti, ceteri vero ex inferioribus subiectorum classibus conscriberentur, et per multos annos continuos retinerentur in manipulis, nunc stipendia honestissima facili obsequio mereantur cives universi, seu sponte sumpta militia sive iusto delectu, et illi post annum, hi post triennii spatium exauctorentur, temporaria posthac militia non nimium molesta quotannis exercitandi, civesque et milites non ut antea alteri ab alteris alienati sint, sed in unum quasi coaluerint corpus.
# reading_translation = Now as for military affairs, which nevertheless seemed to have been excellently organized under the earlier kings, Frederick William so arranged them by a new institution that, whereas previously soldiers were for the most part mercenaries, those men were barely restrained by the most savage punishments and tortures, while the rest were conscripted from the lower classes of subjects and kept in the ranks for many continuous years, now all citizens earn the most honorable service with easy compliance, whether they take up arms voluntarily or by lawful levy, and the former are discharged after a year, the latter after a period of three years, with a temporary militia thereafter, not overly burdensome, to be exercised every year, and citizens and soldiers are not, as before, estranged from one another, but have coalesced, as it were, into one body.
# literal_translation = Now truly the military matter, which nevertheless was seeming under the earlier kings best to have been arranged, by a new institution so arranged Frederick William, that when previously soldiers for a great part mercenaries were, scarcely those by punishments and tortures most savage restrained, the rest however from the lower of the subjects classes were conscripted, and through many years continuous were retained in companies, now service most honorable by easy compliance earn citizens all, whether by own will having been taken up military service or by lawful levy, and those after a year, these after of a three-year period space are discharged, a temporary thereafter militia not too much burdensome every year to be exercised, and citizens and soldiers not as before the ones from the others estranged are, but into one as it were have coalesced body.
# generator = deepseek-v4-pro
