# text = quid a Deo donatum animis accipi devotioribus potest, quam quod maxime expetitum votis universorum erat, ut manerent bona praestantissima, quae beatissimus Pater patriae largitus rei publicae erat, ut semina ab illo iacta aleret heres imperii et nova spargeret uberrimam laetissimamque iamiam datura messem?
# reading_translation = What can be received from God by more devoted minds as a gift, than that which was most earnestly sought by the prayers of all, namely that the most excellent goods should remain, which the most blessed Father of the fatherland had bestowed upon the republic, so that the heir of the empire might nourish the seeds sown by him and scatter new ones, about to yield a most abundant and most joyful harvest?
