# text = nunc quod Dominus noster clementissimus, etsi patrem regeneravit proxime, tamen propria et peculiari indole mirum quam egregia praeditus est, aliud dicenti ingenium induendum, aliam quasi personam sustained video, neque hanc animi excelsitatem a me confido exaequari dictis posse, nec deflorescentem iam et senescentem orationem meam ad novi huius imperii vim, vigorem, fervorem comparatam esse:
# reading_translation = Now I see that, although our most merciful Lord has recently regenerated the father, yet he is endowed with a special and peculiar character, wonderfully excellent, and that a different talent must be assumed for speaking, and a different, as it were, person; and I do not trust that this loftiness of mind can be equaled by my words, nor that my speech, now fading and growing old, can be compared with the force, vigor, and ardor of this new empire.
# literal_translation = Now that our Lord most merciful, although he regenerated the father recently, nevertheless with a special and peculiar character wonderfully how excellent he is endowed, for another speaking a talent to be put on, another as it were person I see, and not this loftiness of mind by me I trust to be equaled by words can, nor that fading already and growing old my speech to the force, vigor, fervor of this new empire compared is:
