# sent_id = orat29.3.33
# text = Tantum enim abest, ut libertas amorem principis imminuat et frangat, ut non possit diligi princeps nisi a liberis, a servis vero potius metui videatur, atque ut, quo liberius constitutum regnum sit, eo sincerius et vehementius amari princeps soleat, praesertim ubi, ut nostra aetate in Britannia, confirmata longinquitate temporis potentia, non nuper demum, neque invita magna civium multitudine, parta sit, et maxime ubi princeps ipse instituerit libertatem sua sponte, neque exspectaverit, donec ea vel vi vel rerum adversarum opportunitate importuna extorqueretur.
# reading_translation = For it is so far from being the case that liberty diminishes and breaks the love of the prince, that a prince cannot be loved except by free men, while by slaves he may rather be feared; and that the more freely a kingdom has been constituted, the more sincerely and vehemently the prince is wont to be loved, especially where, as in our age in Britain, power has been confirmed by long duration of time, and has not been acquired only recently, nor against the will of a great multitude of citizens; and especially where the prince himself has established liberty of his own accord, and has not waited until it should be extorted by force or by the untimely opportunity of adverse circumstances.
# literal_translation = So far indeed it-is-absent, that liberty the-love of-the-prince may-diminish and may-break, that not may-be-able to-be-loved prince unless by-free-men, by-slaves but rather to-be-feared it-may-seem, and that, the-more-freely constituted kingdom may-be, the-more-sincerely and more-vehemently to-be-loved prince is-wont, especially where, as in-our-age in Britain, confirmed by-longness of-time power, not recently at-last, nor unwilling great of-citizens multitude, acquired may-be, and especially where prince himself may-have-established liberty by-his-own-accord, and not may-have-waited, until it either by-force or of-adverse-things by-opportunity untimely might-be-extorted.
# generator = deepseek-chat
