# sent_id = orat30.1.8
# text = Quare ego ita existimo, auditores, quod ego fere solus ex hoc amplissimo professorum collegio constitutus sum, qui verba facerem pro universis, id hanc habere vim, ut liceat hoc loco aliquid proponere eiusmodi, quale paullo ante significavi, ita tamen id explicandum, ut totum illud argumentum, qualecunque est, ad sensum gratiae Domino nostro clementissimo debitae revocetur, isque sensus, veluti anima corpus, permeet quae dicimus.
# reading_translation = Therefore I think, listeners, that the fact that I am almost the only one from this most distinguished body of professors who has been appointed to speak on behalf of all, this fact has this force, that it is permitted in this place to set forth something of such a kind as I indicated a little before, yet in such a way that it must be explained so that that whole argument, whatever it is, is brought back to the sense of gratitude owed to our most merciful Lord, and that this sense, like the soul in the body, permeates what we say.
# literal_translation = Therefore I thus think, listeners, that I almost alone from this most distinguished college of professors have been appointed, who should speak for all, this to have this force, that it may be permitted in this place to propose something of such a kind, which a little before I indicated, yet so it to be explained, that that whole argument, whatever it is, to the sense of gratitude to our most merciful Lord owed may be brought back, and that sense, as soul body, may permeate what we say.
# generator = deepseek-chat
