# reading_translation = Since it has never seemed to me not especially difficult, most distinguished and most honorable auditors of all ranks, on this day from this place before this your assembly, not in my own name alone, but in the name of the great university composed of various and most ample bodies of most learned men, to speak about the supreme ruler of such a great republic, about whom, even if you have proclaimed the best and most excellent things, nevertheless you understand that your words fall far short of his magnificence and goodness, which are confirmed by his deeds;
