# reading_translation = I think I am doing a favor to myself, who have myself experienced the favor of the most august King and am devoted to him with all my heart, and I think I am doing a favor to you, who honor him with equal devotion, when I describe in outline, both by tacitly citing the opinions of the most approved authors in this field and by explaining my own reasoning, what the nature of princely kindness is and what power it has, and, as far as the narrowness of time permits, the rest, since we are more constrained than before by the magnificent speeches of my colleagues which are to be delivered today.
