# sent_id = orat32.1.1
# text = Ad sollemnia haec sanctissima, quae Principi optimo dedicata sunt, rite concelebranda quotquot adestis, auditores omnium ordinum suo quisque loco honorandi, facile sentitis universi maius quiddam hoc conventu agi quam simplicem de unius hominis quamvis excellentis die natali gratulationem habendam.
# reading_translation = For the due celebration of these most sacred solemnities, which are dedicated to the best Prince, all of you who are present, hearers of every rank, each to be honored in his own place, easily perceive as a whole that something greater is being transacted in this assembly than a simple congratulation to be offered on the birthday of one man, however excellent.
